  "(ADU)&rdquo; and to amend Section 139- 7A &ldquo;Use Chart by inserting a new term "
  "&ldquo;Protected Use ADU&rdquo; with a &ldquo;Y&rdquo; in the R-1/SR-1, ROH/SOH, R-5/R-5L, "
  "R-10/R-10L/SR-10, R-20, R-40, V-R, LUG-1, LUG-2, LUG-3, and MMD districts and a "
  "&ldquo;N&rdquo; in the CDT, CMI, CN, CTEC, CI, RC, RC-2, VN, and VTEC "
  "districts.</li><li>Article 49 - Zoning Bylaw Amendment: Definitions &ndash; Gross Floor Area "
  "&ndash; to amend Section 139-2 &ldquo;Definitions and Word Usage&rdquo; by making language "
  "updates to comply with 760 CMR 71.00.</li><li>Article 50 - Zoning Bylaw Amendment: Use Chart "
  "&ndash; Primary Dwelling &ndash; to amend Section 139-7A &ldquo;Use Chart&rdquo; by changing "
  "Primary dwelling from &ldquo;A&rdquo; to &ldquo;N&rdquo; in the CDT, CMI, CN, VN, and VTEC "
  "districts and by changing &ldquo;Y&rdquo; to &ldquo;N&rdquo; in the CTEC, RC, and RC-2 "
  "districts.</li><li>Article 51 - Zoning Bylaw Amendment: Use Chart and Definitions &ndash; "
  "Secondary Dwelling &ndash; to amend Section 139-2 &ldquo;Definitions and Word Usage&rdquo; by "
  "updating the existing definition of &ldquo;Secondary Dwelling&rdquo; to insert new language "
  "related to ownership and/or occupancy requirements, insert new language to clarify enforcement "
  "authority, and add bedroom density requirements and amend Section 139-7A "
  "&ldquo;Use-Chart&rdquo; by changing from a &ldquo;Y&rdquo; to a &ldquo;SP&rdquo; in the R-1, "
  "SR-1, ROH, SOH, CDT, RC, RC-2. And VR districts and by changing from a &ldquo;SP&rdquo; to a "
  "&ldquo;N&rdquo; in the R-5L and R- 10L districts, will also be readvertised with updates to "
  "the use chart for 2/9/26</li><li>Article 52 - Zoning Bylaw Amendment: Use Chart and "
  "Definitions &ndash; Tertiary Dwelling &ndash; to amend Section 139-2 &ldquo;Definitions and "
  "Word Usage&rdquo; by striking the existing definition of &ldquo;Tertiary Dwelling&rdquo; in "
