  "Entrepreneurship and Craft (VTEC) district into the density schedule and amend Section 139-7A "
  "&ldquo;Use-Chart&rdquo; by changing Apartment from &ldquo;N&rdquo; to &ldquo;Y&rdquo; in the "
  "VN and VTEC districts.</li><li>Article 38 - Zoning Bylaw Amendment: Prohibited Uses &ndash; to "
  "amend Section 139-7B(3) &ldquo;prohibited uses&rdquo; to add new language that clarify that "
  "the prohibition of storage containers &ldquo;shall not apply to the use of storage container "
  "or trailers authorized by Special Permit&rdquo;.</li><li>Article 39 - Zoning Bylaw Amendment: "
  "Demolition Delay &ndash; to amend Section 139-26A(1)(f)[5] &ldquo;Demolition Delay&rdquo; by "
  "updating the notice requirement to allow in any &ldquo;print newspaper or electronic media, "
  "having general circulation within the Town of Nantucket&rdquo;.</li><li>Article 41 - Zoning "
