 'facilities; One Million Two Hundred Thousand Dollars ($1,200,000) for costs associated with '
 'the continuation of annual sidewalk improvements; One Million Nine Hundred Eleven Thousand Six '
 'Hundred and Fifty Dollars ($1,911,650) for costs associated with the bicycle and pedestrian '
