 '<h3 class="warrant-doc__art">ARTICLE 2<span>(Zoning and General Bylaw Amendments:  Short-Term '
 'Rentals)</span></h3>'
 '<p>To see if the Town will vote to amend Sections 139 (Zoning Bylaw) and 123 (Short-Term '
 'Rental General Bylaw) as follows (NOTE: new language is shown as highlighted text, language to '
