 '<p>A. Amend the Zoning Bylaw as follows:</p>'
 '<div class="warrant-doc__scroll"><table class="warrant-doc__grid"><tr><td>1.</td><td>Add or '
 'amend the following definitions to &#167;139-2 Definitions and Word Usage</td></tr></table>'
