 '<p>Or to take any other action related thereto.</p>'
 '<p class="warrant-doc__by">(Select Board)  </p>'
 '<h3 class="warrant-doc__art">ARTICLE 81<span>(Real Estate Acquisition:  46 Sparks '
 'Avenue)</span></h3>'
