# The Town’s action summary for the November 4, 2025 Special Town Meeting:
# its two articles, both on short-term rentals, and what the floor did with
# each. Frank sent the text on 2026-10-27, the same day as the 2026 one.
#
# The Town set it differently from the 2026 summary -- a title has the line
# to itself and its vote follows underneath -- which is why
# tools/action-summary.py finds the split between the two rather than
# assuming where it falls. Article 2 records no call at all, as printed.
TM_SUMMARY_STM_2025 = (
 '<p>(Voted in accordance with the motions recommended by the Finance Committee, or, in the '
 'absence of a Finance Committee Motion, then in accordance with the motions as recommended by '
 'the Planning Board, as printed in the Finance Committee Report, with technical amendments '
 'brought forward during the course of the meeting) unless otherwise specified, the motion '
 'adopted is the motion of the Finance Committee or the Planning Board as set forth in the '
 'Warrant Booklet and the Technical Amendments made.</p>'
 '<p><strong>Article 1: Zoning Bylaw: Amendments relating to Long-Term and Short-Term Rentals '
 '(Borgeson) (Called)</strong> Vote on Mr. Borgeson&rsquo;s Positive Motion - Yes: 1045 No: 421 '
 '2/3rds Majority met, Positive Motion is adopted.</p>'
 '<p><strong>Article 2: Zoning and General Bylaw Amendments: Short-Term Rentals</strong> Mr. '
 'David Iverson, Planning Board: Move to Take No Action. Vote on Move to Take No Action: Yes: '
 '925, No: 485. Move to Take No Action Motion is adopted.</p>'
)

