   "interviews his new co-host, Sunny Daily, about the Foundation she runs. She came to it "
   "almost four years ago from direct health care work on the island, as a midwife, doula, "
   "childbirth educator and lactation consultant, wanting a wider reach than one family at a "
   "time; she started as program director and took over as executive director two years later. "
   "She describes a community foundation as a resource rather than a cause: for donors who care "
