# PAST TV SHOWS — NCTV's own programming, laid out like the NHA page: a
# logo banner, a line of introduction, then collapsible groups of shows.
# Each show is a row: (name, description, first episode, last episode). A date
# not yet known is left empty and renders as a dash. The table draws nothing at
# all while the list is empty, so the page can stand on its banner and intro.
