  "deep ties to Nantucket, his maritime legacy, and his connection to the Shallop, illuminating "
  "how his story expands and enriches our understanding of American and Island history. Learn "
  "more about the Paul Cuffe story project and upcoming screenings of CUFFE: TAXED at "
