  "https://www.youtube.com/@UC0b_-gCPbcLrQELpp4IMekg. Panelists: Anita Allison, Film Maker "
  "Robert Cox, Direct Descendant of Paul Cuffe David Cole, Historian and Author of Paul Cuffe: "
