  "at the Ballard Institute and Museum of Puppetry. In 2023, Christopher was a guest lecturer at "
  "the Norman Rockwell Museum&rsquo;s Tony Sarg Symposium. E.A. KAHANE has focused on capturing "
  "joy, life, and her surroundings through photography. Her process of taking pictures has led "
  "to a diverse body of work ranging from portraits to landscape, still-lifes to large public "
  "installations. Documentation of events such as the Macy&rsquo;s Thanksgiving Day Parade in "
  "New York or the Mille Miglia race in Italy are experiences that she captures through the "
  "lens. In turn, she uses the power of the exhibition and environment to transport the viewer. "
