  "through 2024 at "
  "https://nha.org/whats-on/exhibitions/featured-exhibitions/tony-sarg-genius-at-play/. "
  "Stephanie Haboush Plunkett is the Chief Curator and Rockwell Center Director of the Norman "
  "Rockwell Museum, and the curator of many exhibitions relating to the art of illustration, "
  "including Tony Sarg: Genius at Play; Imprinted: Illustrating Race; Enduring Ideals: Rockwell, "
