  "Hopper: Edward Hopper as Illustrator. She leads the Rockwell Center for American Visual "
  "Studies, an institute devoted to the study of illustration art. Drawing Lessons from the "
  "Famous Artists School; Norman Rockwell: Drawings, 1911-1976; Imprinted: Illustrating Race; "
  "Tony Sarg: Genius at Play; and Leo Lionni: Storyteller, Illustrator, Designer are recent "
  "publications. She is currently at work on What, Me Worry? The Art and Design of MAD Magazine. "
  "Lenore D. Miller, Curator Emerita of the George Washington University Museum, retired as "
  "director of university art galleries and chief curator in 2020 after almost 50 years with "
  "George Washington University (GW) art galleries. She led the Luther W. Brady Art Gallery team "
