  "fifteen years. An island resident remains in a coma after being pulled unconscious from the "
  "harbor, with friends raising more than $21,000 for the family. A meteor that broke up "
  "thirty-one miles above the island on Saturday is thought to have come down in Cape Cod Bay, "
  "where scientists may go after the pieces with magnets, and a special report previews a World "
