  "the operator who has managed it since 1993 and owned it since 2022, after the company that "
  "owns the property declined to extend his lease last May. The anchors report the unease that "
  "has followed: another long-standing island business passing to outside investors, and what "
  "that does to Nantucket&rsquo;s character and its year-round residents. The Steamship "
  "Authority is weighing fare increases for 2027 against higher fuel and operating costs "
  "&mdash; up to $29 more each way for a car in the busy season, $2.50 more for an adult "
  "high-speed ticket and a dollar more on the slow boat &mdash; which together would raise "
