# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# NANTUCKET ISLAND CHAMBER OF COMMERCE — custom partner page, replacing the
# placeholder the generic loop used to build.
#
# The Chamber's own channel holds 75 videos. The 54 below are its programming;
# the other 21 are left off on purpose: fifteen destination spots of 15 to 45
# seconds, several of them alternate cuts of the same spot, three member-portal
# how-tos, and three short morale messages from the spring of 2020. None of
# them is a recording of anything. Add any of them here if that call changes.
